<![CDATA[<span style="font-size: 12pt;">Dear&nbsp;{!Case.First_Name__c},</span><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="font-size: 12pt;">Your access to Salesforce has been set up.</div><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="font-size: 12pt;">Please find the <a href="https://qantas.my.salesforce.com/sfc/p/900000010OOK/a/2v000000XtVf/ynqAhywKYXvfhSxIGzI0c.xhJmQU05tDWzry1bw5lhs">link</a> to Quick Reference Guide containing instructions on how to log into Salesforce.</div><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="font-size: 12pt;">Kindly let us know if you have any queries or issues accessing Salesforce.</div><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><div><i><font size="2">Please note: if you have not signed into&nbsp;<a href="http://theterminal.qantas.com.au/">The Terminal</a>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<a href="https://qantas.my.salesforce.com/sfc/p/900000010OOK/a/2v000000XtVk/IE3CJRUfpeKeKhLmMiDRvKXkMPQ1DjLcs4hF376E8_U">set up multi-factor authentication</a>, please do so before trying to log into Salesforce.&nbsp;</font></i></div><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><br></div></div><div style=""><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Thanks,</span></div><div style="font-size: 12pt;">Salesforce Business Connect Team</div><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><img src="https://qantas--c.ap15.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=0159000000FSVke&amp;oid=00D8s00000IDoz7" border="0" align="left" alt=""><br></div><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><br></div>]]></td>
</tr>
